% covers: 10 - POST /api with the token and Sec-Fetch-Site: same-origin is 200 OK and evaluated, and a following request that sends no Sec-Fetch-Site header, as a golden case or a script, is unaffected and sees x
POST /api HTTP/1.1
Host: 127.0.0.1:8123
Sec-Fetch-Site: same-origin
X-SplatCrab-Token: test-token
Content-Type: application/json
Content-Length: 39

{"id":1,"op":"eval","code":"x = 1 + 2"}
POST /api HTTP/1.1
Host: 127.0.0.1:8123
X-SplatCrab-Token: test-token
Content-Type: application/json
Content-Length: 37

{"id":2,"op":"eval","code":"disp(x)"}
